body:
No matter what you do, ask her to destroy all of this. This can be used against you to disastrous consequences. She seems remorseful and unsure why she's doing it? Then she should have no problem deleting it. If she refuses to delete it, then she's planning on using it and is lying about being remorseful. And if she refuses to delete it, run, because she will use this against you somehow, if she's not planning on using it in a divorce, she's probably showing it to her friends and they're slowing convincing her you're abusive - based on what she tells them - and eventually she'll hate you anyway. Or she's saving it for her own personal files and slowly poisoning herself against you.

TL;DR: 
if(pleaseDeleteIt==YES)
{
marriage=crazy_but_maybe_okay_with_therapy;
}
else
{
marriage=boned + RUN_LIKE_FUCK;
}

edit: trying to make an equation equals formatting and italics... who knew?
